/// M09 CORE-027 "bundled input capture: roots green, raw-backed inventory".
/// Source: tests/integration/input_capture_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledInputCapture (L46-246).
/// Related fixtures: none shipped; the staged src/main.can (Go L99) and
/// vendor/src/lib.can (Go L102-103) are inline in the Go test, with the
/// raw fixture JSON inline at L104-108.
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): static assert inventory of the staged capture
/// project as the green baseline: exactly 4 roots at the assert stage
/// (root 3 + vendor 1), matching the Go report length pin (L169).
/// ADAPTATION (recorded, with source lines): the load_helper when-table
/// rows (L99: sample use helpers::fetched(7), direct => ok) are call
/// routing rows, not assert roots, and are excluded from the per-function
/// counts per the CORE-008/014 precedent (when-table rows are not
/// declaration.Assertions roots); the vendor fixture cases (L102: two
/// cases) are fixture data, not assert roots either.
/// Facet map (input_capture_test.go legs plus staged arms): assert-green
/// pins the would-be canlc assert exit (L165: exit 0, empty diagnostics);
/// report-passed pins the report flag (L169: passed true); root-count
/// pins the total (L169: 4 assertions); fixture-name pins the primary
/// raw fixture path (L102: fixtures/load.json, the fetch decoded arm);
/// load-helper-roots pins load_helper (L99: direct 1 root);
/// load-consumer-roots pins load_consumer (L99: sample 1 root);
/// main-roots pins main (L99: empty 1 root); vendor-load-roots pins the
/// vendor fetch (L102: decoded 1 root).
/// Capture semantics live in core-027-capture-semantics.can; the
/// production process shape lives in core-027-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: none in this file (default only); timeout 5000/6000 and
/// fixture bytes before/after mutation live in the capture file.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/WORK/PROC/N1
/// and C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now. Descriptor
/// timeout 240000ms mirrors the Go 4-minute ctx (L52).
/// Delegated oracles: none.
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23/QN1 unmet).
/// Case capture/bundled-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, load-helper-roots, load-consumer-roots,
/// main-roots, vendor-load-roots.
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
record context
